13
00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:40.240
[George] Taft's ultimate, lifelong dream was singular and unshakable.

14
00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:44.800
[George] He longed to sit upon the Supreme Court of the United States as Chief Justice.

15
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:51.280
