[George] Arriving in Manila, Taft astonished military commanders by treating the Filipino people with genuine respect, calling them his little brown brothers and building thousands of schools, hospitals and roads.

26
00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:36.280
[George] When President Theodore Roosevelt twice offered to appoint Taft to the Supreme Court, his ultimate dream, Taft courageously turned T.R.

