90
00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:31.160
[George] Taft served on the High Court for nine magnificent years, modernizing the federal judiciary, championing the construction of the Supreme Court building, and declaring with complete honesty: I don't remember that I ever was president.

91
00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:32.920
