92
00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:45.880
[George] Backslash N backslash and Taft's eventual elevation to Chief Justice of the United States allowed him to fulfill his life's true ambition, modernizing the Supreme Court and authoring over 250 opinions.

93
00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:56.280
[George] As Chief Justice, Taft streamlined federal court administration and secured congressional funding for the Supreme Court's magnificent marble building in Washington.

94
00:12:56.280 --> 00:13:10.040
